  "descriptionHtml": "<p>The Thompson Street satchel slips seamlessly into your workday rotation and weekend plans, thanks to a top handle and an adjustable crossbody strap that let you style it your way. Inside, a center zip divider and a slip pocket keep essentials sorted. Crafted in pebbled leather, our structured satchel brings a polished finish to any look.</p>\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin-top: 1.5rem;\">\n<h4 style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\">Specifications & Details</h4>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: none; padding-left: 0; font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.6;\">\n<li><strong>Material:</strong> Pebbled leather</li>\n<li><strong>Lining:</strong> Fabric lining</li>\n<li><strong>Hardware:</strong> Gold hardware</li>\n<li><strong>Handle Drop:</strong> 4.25&quot; handle drop</li>\n<li><strong>Shoulder Strap Drop:</strong> Adjustable and removable crossbody strap with 22&quot; drop at center hole</li>\n<li><strong>Pockets:</strong> Middle zip compartment</li>\n<li><strong>Bag Dimensions:</strong> 13.4&quot; (L) x 9&quot; (H) x 5.40&quot; (W)</li>\n</ul>\n</div>",
